      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIFE OF RILEY (1) was in the minors two back (20.16) at this track but ran below best last time at Gawler, finishing 6th. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can atone. SPRINGVALE MARGI (2) finds it hard to win. Finished second (23.22) at Gawler latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Hard to beat again. SHE'S GOT DESIGN (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last start finished 2nd over 342m at this track beaten 4 lengths (19.94) behind Fine View in a TG1-4W on August 18. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to her name from eight starts. Can measure up. JUST ON FIRE (5) is in form and must include among the chances.",
